# LyfeDesk approved apps: the catalog. One ENTRY per package folder in this repo.
# ENTRY | id | KIND | phone-app | VERSION | n | SHA256 | tree hash of the package folder
# Tree hash = sha256 of the lines "<sha256 of file>  <relative path>" in bytewise path order, i.e.
#   (cd <id> && find . -type f | sed "s#^\./##" | LC_ALL=C sort | xargs sha256sum | sha256sum)
# Source only: no compiled binaries, no symlinks, no ops/+x folders (the store refuses them). Change a package = new hash here = a new commit to pin.
ENTRY | stock-x | KIND | phone-app | VERSION | 1 | SHA256 | 15d152e919e6a28e7c6b5ddaa19c78c486915854c2c0a4975bd6966518f4c20c
ENTRY | true-swords-clash | KIND | phone-app | VERSION | 1 | SHA256 | 2fb81adc6d253d69832b0f38739f706aed089d8638f23db2896bff18a442027a
ENTRY | bible-verses | KIND | phone-dep | VERSION | 1 | SHA256 | b04ecfb28b638e27c0775988ad18d8fca186d4e9bbb06b632d22763ef8bc9fe6
